id: fashionable-accessories
name: Fashionable Accessories
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
craftDC: Qualified
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Morale Saving Throw 1(bT) higher, while Standard Clothing is worn with it.
text: >
  Fashionable Accessories: This collection of pins, jewelry, sashes, and other assorted
  wearable items is the perfect accent to your everyday wear, making you feel like a million
  zeni.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Effects: Increase your Morale Saving Throws by 1(bT) while wearing Standard Clothing in
  addition to this Accessory.

---

# "While wearing Standard Clothing": Standard Clothing is an Apparel Category, so any piece of
# Apparel built as it, and worn.
#
# Not built yet: wearing Apparel - its Layers come with the rest of the Apparel rules. Until
# then no Apparel is worn, and this adds nothing. `wearing` reads the same `equipped` an
# Accessory is put on with - if Apparel is worn some other way, that is where to change it.
[passive]
if (wearing("standard-clothing")) {
  save.morale += 1(bT);
}
